title: 밤_2_편의점_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
(As I arrive at the convenience store, I see NaHyun's back under a streetlight.)
<<play hyun_sound>>
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
(NaHyun is crouching down in front of some bushes.)
<<choice 밤_2_편의점_긍정1_영문 "NaHyun!" 밤_2_편의점_부정1_영문 "(Approach quietly)">>
(Should I go say hi?)
===

title: 밤_2_편의점_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: NaHyun!
(As I call out her name, NaHyun flinches and shudders as if startled.)
<<play 양나현_쉿>>
<<show hyun_neg_ver2>>
NaHyun: (Looking back) Shh! 
(NaHyun puts a finger to her lips.)
(As I get closer, I finally see the cat—Bong-won in front of her.)
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Luckily, Bong-won doesn't seem to mind and is just lying there in front of NaHyun.)
{name()}: (Whispering) Oh, sorry. I didn't know Bong-won was here.
{name()}: I didn't expect to run into Bong-won outside of campus.
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
<<dislike 양나현>>
NaHyun: Well... it's fine. Hey, {name()}.
<<jump 밤_2_편의점_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 밤_2_편의점_부정1_영문
---
(I quietly approach NaHyun without making a sound.)
(As I get closer, I see Bong-won the cat lying in front of her.)
(I carefully crouch down next to NaHyun.)
{name()}: (Whispering) Hey.
NaHyun: (Whispering) Oh, hey {name()}. 
<<show hyun_smile_ver2>>
NaHyun: It's Bong-won. Did I introduce you two before?
{name()}: I didn't expect to run into Bong-won outside of campus.
NaHyun: Right? I was surprised too.
<<play 공통_야옹>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<like 양나현>>
(Bong-won starts purring.)
<<jump 밤_2_편의점_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 밤_2_편의점_양나현_분기1_영문
---
(Bong-won stretches, stands up, and walks toward NaHyun, rubbing his forehead against her leg.)
<<show hyun_shock_ver2>>
NaHyun: ...!!
(NaHyun freezes up, looking flustered.)
(It seems like he wants to be petted...)
{name()}: I think he wants you to pet him.
{name()}: Give it a try.
<<show hyun_blush_ver2>>
NaHyun: ...Is it... really okay?
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Bong-won lets out a meow as if urging her.)
<<choice 주2_화_밤_편의점_긍정2_영문 "(Pet Bong-won first.)" 주2_화_밤_편의점_부정2_영문 "Just watch.">>
(NaHyun is still hesitating.)
===

title: 주2_화_밤_편의점_긍정2_영문
---
(I reach out first and gently stroke Bong-won's head.)
<<show hyun_shock_ver2>>
(Bong-won closes his eyes, looking satisfied.)
{name()}: See? He likes it.
(After stroking him a few times, I pull my hand away.)
{name()}: Your turn.
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
(NaHyun carefully reaches out her hand and strokes Bong-won.)
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Bong-won purrs again, seemingly content.)
<<show hyun_smile_ver2>>
NaHyun: !!
(As she pets him, Bong-won licks NaHyun's hand.)
NaHyun: !! Did you see that?
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
(NaHyun can't hide her excitement.)
(Bong-won licks her hand a few more times before disappearing into the bushes.)
NaHyun: Wow... I can't believe it.
NaHyun: It feels like I just got a birthday present from Bong-won.
<<change lvHyun +10>>
<<like 양나현>>
NaHyun: Thanks for giving me the courage. I was really debating whether to do it or not...
(I chatted with NaHyun a bit more about Bong-won before we parted ways.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_밤_편의점_부정2_영문
---
{name()}: On second thought... what if he scratches you?
{name()}: It's probably better to just watch.
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
NaHyun: True...... I wouldn't want to make Bong-won uncomfortable by mistake.
(I sat with NaHyun and just watched Bong-won.)
(Bong-won hovered around for a while, then disappeared into the bushes, perhaps looking for food.)
NaHyun: I should head home now.
<<end>>
===